    <Node ToolID="31">
      <GuiSettings Plugin="AlteryxGuiToolkit.TextBox.TextBox">
        <Position x="2034" y="438" width="100" height="40" />
      </GuiSettings>
      <Properties>
        <Configuration>
          <Text>Operational Playbook – Linking the Files
The workflow joins the Portuguese and Maths learner datasets using the Join tool. The Join produced 675 matched records, with 0 unmatched records. The data is divided into Training (70% = 473 records), Validation (15% ≈ 101 records), and Production (15% ≈ 101 records). The workflow is documented to support reproducibility and future maintenance.</Text>
          <Font name="Arial" size="8.25" style="0" />
          <TextColor name="Black" />
          <FillColor name="White" />
          <Shape shape="1" />
          <Justification Justification="4" />
        </Configuration>
        <Annotation DisplayMode="0">
          <Name />
          <DefaultAnnotationText />
          <Left value="False" />
        </Annotation>
      </Properties>
    </Node>
    <Node ToolID="32">
      <GuiSettings Plugin="AlteryxBasePluginsGui.Formula.Formula">
        <Position x="1314" y="486" />
      </GuiSettings>
      <Properties>
        <Configuration>
          <FormulaFields>
            <FormulaField expression="IF ToNumber([absences]) &lt;= 2 THEN &quot;Regular&quot;&#xA;ELSEIF ToNumber([absences]) &lt;= 6 THEN &quot;Watch&quot;&#xA;ELSE &quot;Concern&quot;&#xA;ENDIF" field="Band" size="2147483647" type="V_String" enabled="true" />
            <FormulaField expression="IF IsNull([G1]) THEN [Right_G1]&#xA;ELSEIF IsNull([Right_G1]) THEN [G1]&#xA;ELSE Min([G1], [Right_G1])&#xA;ENDIF" field="baseline_g1" size="2147483647" type="V_String" enabled="true" />
            <FormulaField expression="IF ToNumber([baseline_g1]) &lt; 10 THEN 1 ELSE 0 ENDIF" field="g1_flag" size="4" type="Int32" enabled="true" />
            <FormulaField expression="IF ToNumber([failures]) &gt;= 1 THEN 1 ELSE 0 ENDIF" field="failures_flag" size="4" type="Int32" enabled="true" />
            <FormulaField expression="IF ToNumber([studytime]) = 1 THEN 1 ELSE 0 ENDIF" field="studytime_flag" size="4" type="Int32" enabled="true" />
            <FormulaField expression="[g1_flag] + [failures_flag] + [studytime_flag]" field="risk_score" size="4" type="Int32" enabled="true" />
            <FormulaField expression="IF [risk_score] &gt;= 2 THEN &quot;High&quot;&#xA;ELSEIF [risk_score] = 1 THEN &quot;Medium&quot;&#xA;ELSE &quot;Low&quot;&#xA;ENDIF" field="Tier" size="2147483647" type="V_String" enabled="true" />
          </FormulaFields>
        </Configuration>
        <Annotation DisplayMode="0">
          <Name />
          <AnnotationText>Step 3 – Supporting Flags and Risk Tiering:
Creates an attendance band using absences: 0–2 = Regular, 3–6 = Watch, and 7+ = Concern. Calculates the baseline G1 score using the available G1 value from either subject, then creates a G1 flag when the baseline G1 score is below 10. Adds a failures flag for students with at least one past failure and a study-time flag for students with low study time. Combines these flags into a risk score and assigns each student to a High, Medium, or Low risk Tier.</AnnotationText>
          <DefaultAnnotationText>Band = IF ToNumber([absences]) &lt;= 2 THEN "Regular"
ELSEIF ToNumber([absences]) &lt;...</DefaultAnnotationText>
          <Left value="False" />
        </Annotation>
      </Properties>
      <EngineSettings EngineDll="AlteryxBasePluginsEngine.dll" EngineDllEntryPoint="AlteryxFormula" />
    </Node>
    <Node ToolID="33">
      <GuiSettings Plugin="AlteryxBasePluginsGui.Test.Test">
        <Position x="1470" y="486" />
      </GuiSettings>
      <Properties>
        <Configuration>
          <Tests>
            <Test>
              <Name>Risk Score Range</Name>
              <Connection>#1</Connection>
              <Type>ExpAll</Type>
              <Value>[risk_score] &gt;= 0 AND [risk_score] &lt;= 3</Value>
            </Test>
            <Test>
              <Name>Learner Key Not Blank</Name>
              <Connection>#1</Connection>
              <Type>ExpAll</Type>
              <Value>NOT IsNull([match_string])</Value>
            </Test>
          </Tests>
          <DontReportSubsequent value="False" />
        </Configuration>
        <Annotation DisplayMode="0">
          <Name />
